IMPORT prelude

-- Labour Hire Licensing Act 2018 (Vic) -- the dates, in one small module.
--
-- It uses only the built-in date functions (DATE_FROM_DMY, DATE_SERIAL, DATE_FROM_SERIAL, DATE_DAY, DATE_MONTH,
-- DATE_YEAR), not the daydate library. The Act counts in plain days ("within 14 days after the notice is given", s 42(2)(c);
-- "within 28 days of being notified", s 102(1); "within 30 days of the change", s 43), in weeks ("during the 6 weeks
-- before it falls due", s 35(2)), in months ("3 months immediately preceding", s 18(1)(b); "12 months beginning on the day",
-- s 34(5)) and in years ("within the preceding 2 years", s 18(1)(a); "3 years after the day", s 26; "6 years", ss 67(2),
-- 93(7), 105).
--
-- UNOFFICIAL VERSION: quotations from a plain-text conversion by Legalese Commons of the Word file of the Labour Hire
-- Licensing Act 2018, Version No. 009 (1 October 2026), not the authorised version. (c) State of Victoria; published with
-- the authority of the Government Printer for the State of Victoria. No part may be reproduced except in accordance with
